&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/184443/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500 !important;   "&gt;Svelte Bricks 0.5&lt;/a&gt; – Svelte masonry component with SSR support.&lt;/p&gt;
